1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,486
A population pyramid stacks age groups from young at the bottom to old at the top, males on the left, females on the right.

2
00:00:07,486 --> 00:00:13,151
A broad base and a narrow top means many births and many deaths: rapid growth.

3
00:00:13,151 --> 00:00:16,145
Near vertical sides mean slow growth.

4
00:00:16,145 --> 00:00:20,859
And a base narrower than the middle means a population starting to shrink.

